# Environment variable template for advanced-rag.
#
# Usage:
#   1. Copy this file to .env  (PowerShell: Copy-Item .env.example .env)
#   2. Fill in real values in .env only. .env is git-ignored.
#   3. Never put real credentials in this file; it is committed.
#
# No variables are required yet. The LLM provider, embedding model, vector
# store and tracing (LangSmith) have not been chosen. Each variable will be
# added here, with a description, in the milestone that introduces it.
